},"1357":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"1358":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"1359":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#adornments","content":"Fixed text before and after the input, such as currency. Leading and trailing content is\ncomposed inside the `Group` and its position comes from source order."},"1360":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#multiline","content":"Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry."},"1361":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#sizes","content":"Compare the supported `md` and `sm` visual sizes, plain and with an icon plus control button.\nSet `size` on `TextField` so the input and `Button slot=\"control\"` share the same size."},"1362":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#controls-and-icons","content":"Put a control or an icon beside the input. A `Button slot=\"control\"` is an\ninteractive affix; static content is wrapped in a `Flex as=\"span\"` to center it and give it a gutter."},"1363":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#telephone-field","content":"Compose a telephone number input paired with a country-code select."},"1364":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-29","page